#X text 477 17 Here's more than a variation and just something else. We use [comb.filt~] and take the lowpass filter out of the feedback loop \, so it goes too far as technically we have anything but an actual Karplus Strong Algorithm. It's here as a comparison so you can check out., f 57;
#X text 477 98 In this example we also change the excitation signal to a pink noise generator. The filter is also different \, it's a 2 pole RESONANT filter \, which could be yet another variation to be be used inside the feedback loop! In doing so \, you can also think about adding soft clipping to things don't blow up! Ok \, enough ideas..., f 57;
