#X text 47 76 Let's get more creative. This variation allows for a Note On/Note Off input \, where you can hold the note down longer than its period. This adds a "sustain" for the excitation signal (which is a white noise inside the subpatch). But a short value can result in an excitation signal shorter than the period. An attack and release parameter adds a fade in/out to the excitation signal., f 55;
